-- Business rules for energy, compiled from the model's rules.
--
-- Generated by @appwithai/generator — do not edit by hand; regenerate instead.
-- Applied by `cargo loco task seed_rules` and by `cargo loco db seed`.
--
-- Each statement conflicts on (entity_name, operation, rule_name) and updates
-- only when `appwithai.rules_overwrite` is set to 'on' — which the seed task
